Z||000004||BOILERMAKER||09-23-2000||10:35 PM||||Sorry Greg, I wish that I had seen your car.  I probably would have flagged you down to see if you knew the forum.  O well, I did see a Ferrari (know it isn't a Fiero, but it was cool to me).<P>Scott, yes we will see you soon.  Hopefully we will catch up on the sleep by then (of course, I've always heard that there is no such thing as catching up on sleep).  Crazy and hectic trip, but well worth it.||||reg||1
